+JSON bytes. Its sibling `.json` identity record contains the decoded and gzip
+sizes and SHA-256 values. All files use normal Git storage. The geometry is never
+base64-encoded or split into text chunks. Standard gzip tools open the binary
+payload; the authoring generators remain readable Python.
 
