-orphaned files. A descriptor is never silently treated as an empty model.
+The shared loader validates compressed size/SHA-256, decoded size/SHA-256, UTF-8
+and complete single-member gzip boundaries. Decoded input is bounded to 16 MiB.
+Plain JSON remains accepted by authoring tools and inline test fixtures. New
+runtime embeddings always use the binary include macro.
 
