+python3 tools/model_asset_storage.py compress path/to/model.mesh.json
 ```
 
-All 498 conversions were checked byte-for-byte against their committed canonical
-predecessors. Existing geometric, material, joint and float-bit equivalence tests
-validate the decoded models, not envelope metadata. Compression does not change
-vertices, normals, indices, material colors, rig pivots, precision or signed zero.
+Compression uses an empty filename, zero timestamp and fixed compression level.
+Repacking a native stored model preserves its existing gzip stream exactly.
 
-## Representative loading check
+## Lossless migration
 
-Three alternating native headless runs loaded the same four maps (bedroom,
-Goldenrod, Ecruteak and Ice Path) with the prior plain-JSON executable and the
-compressed executable. All resulting coverage/mesh reports were identical.
-Median wall time was 1.070 seconds plain and 1.069 seconds compressed; median
-child peak RSS was 302,028 KiB and 294,672 KiB respectively. This small sample
-checks loading regressions, not a universal startup or GPU-memory benchmark.
-The native immersive-battle executable also built and displayed the same model
-scene, and the `wasm32-unknown-unknown` check passed.
+`tools/migrate_asset_storage.py` is a one-time reader for the old transport format.
+It validates every old part and complete-file identity before writing, preserves
+all 70 existing compressed `.blend` files and the decoded bytes of all 655 models,
+reuses all 638 previously compressed runtime streams, and deterministically
+compresses the 17 previously plain model files. It removes the obsolete chunks
+and wrappers only after validating their exact ownership. It refuses differing
+preexisting binary files instead of overwriting local edits. `--check` validates
+and reports without writing; a second migration is idempotent.
+
+The operation does not regenerate geometry, alter float precision/signed zero,
+flatten shared human geometry, or rewrite Git history. Editable scenes and
+[genuine PNG source previews](../../art/johto/ASSETS.md) remain independently
+browsable. Cargo/native/Wasm and visual results should be reported only after
+running those checks on the final integrated change.
